    "type": "question",
    "label": "11",
    "prompt": "Becky earns $\\$5$ less than Ben each week, and Jake earns 4 times the amount that Becky earns each week. Ben earns $\\$17$ each week. How much does Jake earn each week?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\$48$ each week.",
      "worked": "Becky's weekly earnings:\n\n$$17-5=12$$\n\nJake's weekly earnings:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}4\\times(17-5)&=4\\times12\\\\4\\times(17-5)&=48\\end{align*}$$\n\nJake earns $\\$48$ each week.",
